2. Una historia de la música electrónica","author":"Javier Blánquez (ed.)","start":2010,"end":2017,"desc":"La desviación indie y experimental del R&B, con préstamos del dubstep, el deep house y otros géneros recién llegados.","color":"#f87171","family":"Hip hop, breaks y ritmo lento","link":"https://volteret4.github.io/loops_timeline/#alt-rnb"}],"book_tracks":[],"mentions":[],"podcast":[{"kind":"podcast","title":"2024 Grammy Nominations Frontrunner","body":"SZA was identified as the frontrunner for Album of the Year nominations at the 2024 Grammys, based on meeting five key criteria: cultural impact (SOS spent 10 weeks at #1), cultural relevance (music played across pop, rap, alternative rock), youth (34 years old), non-repeater (only one prior genre Grammy for a Doja Cat single), and benefiting hip-hop as \"this generation's queen of hip hop soul.\" \"on every level SIZA deserves to win.\"","year":2024,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"Hit Parade Music History and Music Trivia","episode":"And the Grammy Goes to… Edition Part 2","url":null},{"source":"Hit Parade Music History and Music Trivia","episode":"And the Grammy Goes to… Edition Part 2","url":"https://shows.acast.com/hit-parade/episodes/695d4eef154465cd600c4ddc"}]},{"kind":"podcast","title":"Early Collaboration with Kendrick Lamar","body":"Reysa collaborated with Kendrick Lamar when Lamar was still a minor, indicating his early recognition and involvement with emerging talent. \"ya siendo menor de edad ya tenemos colaboraciones suyas con gente tan importante, pues como Snoop Dogg, como Reysa.\"","year":null,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"Music Radar Clan","episode":"Kendrick Lamar:  To pimp a butterfly","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ENmSJbhbGeo"}]},{"kind":"podcast","title":"Grammy Nominations - Nine in One Night","body":"SZA is nominated for nine Grammy Awards at the 66th annual edition. If she wins all nine, she will set a new record for the most Grammys won in a single night. \"If by some chance, Sizzah sweeps all nine prizes she's up for, she will set a new record for most Grammys 1 in a single night.\"","year":null,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"Hit Parade Music History and Music Trivia","episode":"And the Grammy Goes to… Edition Part 1","url":null},{"source":"Hit Parade Music History and Music Trivia","episode":"And the Grammy Goes to… Edition Part 1","url":"https://shows.acast.com/hit-parade/episodes/695d4ef0154465cd600c4e3a"}]},{"kind":"podcast","title":"Prior Grammy Win (Supporting Role)","body":"SZA had won only one prior Grammy in a genre category for a supporting role on a Doja Cat single. This made her a \"non-repeater\" in the general field categories, bolstering her candidacy for Album of the Year at the 2024 Grammys. \"SIZA has only won one prior Grammy in a genre category for a supporting role on a doja cat single.\"","year":null,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"Hit Parade Music History and Music Trivia","episode":"And the Grammy Goes to… Edition Part 2","url":null},{"source":"Hit Parade Music History and Music Trivia","episode":"And the Grammy Goes to… Edition Part 2","url":"https://shows.acast.com/hit-parade/episodes/695d4eef154465cd600c4ddc"}]}],"awards":[],"concerts":[],"xref":[],"charts":[{"id":220600602333611,"type":"album","name":"Ctrl","list_id":84472050122582,"list":"AOTY Must Hear 2010s","src":"musthear","rank":294,"year":2017,"note":null,"yt":"oUzIlVuGdtE","scaruffi":null},{"id":null,"type":null,"name":"Love Galore","list_id":null,"list":"Billboard Year-End Hot 100","src":"ensayos","rank":80,"year":2017,"note":null,"yt":null,"scaruffi":null,"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Billboard_Year-End_Hot_100_singles_of"},{"id":220600602333611,"type":"album","name":"Ctrl","list_id":50254398381317,"list":"Pitchfork: The 200 Best Albums of the 2010s","src":"musthear","rank":24,"year":2017,"note":null,"yt":"oUzIlVuGdtE","scaruffi":null},{"id":220600602333611,"type":"album","name":"Ctrl","list_id":85048702844562,"list":"RYM Top — R&B","src":"mu